# Tailwind

- Use Tailwind utilities for component styling.
- Keep the Tailwind v4 import in `app/globals.css`.
- Prefer semantic HTML, responsive utilities, and visible focus states.
- Extract a component only when UI or behavior is genuinely reused.
- Avoid arbitrary values when a stock utility expresses the design.
